**Open Question (Owner-specific supported recipes and measured costs)** · `open:nrz:tiles-streams-owner-choices`

Owners must name their supported family origin/membership recipes and shape/layout classes, prove each node's flushed absence semantics, and publish the branch-copy cost coefficients and disabled-tracing measurement for their implementation. The recommended starting capability is an explicitly enumerated scalar/origin recipe subset with the charged exact-rational certificate fallback of (`rule:nrz:tiles-streams-barrier-evaluation`), (`rule:nrz:tiles-streams-barrier-cache`). The recommended branch representation is the mask-view default of (`rule:nrz:tiles-streams-branch-choice`) until known consumers and measured coefficients justify copying. Each owner retains the final supported-subset and cost-model choices, subject to those proof and cost contracts. Literal lookup/storage evidence remains with its existing owner obligations; portable retention lifecycle completion is not inferred from the graph-cache lifetime. These choices determine supported capability and measured cost, not the decided ownership, one-bit masks, charged lookup, zero-exact-work kernel boundary, graph walk or full-flush contract. Unsupported recipes and unfit quantified domains remain explicit outcomes. Parameterized exact origin evidence, safe independent loans, reusable lowering and complete observable resource ownership are required capabilities.

**Criterion (A slice proves its named capability)** · `crit:nrz:tiles-streams-acceptance`

Each implementation slice supplies the owner capability and acceptance evidence linked above, preserving existing limits/defaults/pins and all original semantic obligations. It states its supported questions, ordered quantifiers, recipes, workloads, lifecycle operations and claim scopes under (`rule:nrz:lc-grid-acceptance-scope`). A green cache microfixture does not prove arbitrary family membership, a valid mask does not prove its cut, and a steady kernel benchmark does not include unreported barrier or delivery work. Acceptance requires complete attributed costs, independent semantic/mutation controls, bounded residence, current live attachments and honest flush completion. An LC instantiation supplies the projection and decision laws required by these contracts. LC prerequisite and integrated delivery standing belong to (`sec:nrz:lc-closing-register`); the worked examples above specify required behavior and supply no execution or scale result.

